      "impact_statement": "print_string_ptr is linked (through cJSON_PrintUnformatted). The overflow needs one string with approximately 858,993,460 control characters. The ESP32-C3 has approximately 400 KB of RAM, and the HTTP request bodies are limited to a few KB, so no input can supply such a string."
