      "impact_statement": "The CVE is about the Ubuntu wpa_supplicant package: a local user loads a shared object through D-Bus or the control interface. The ESP-IDF wpa_supplicant component builds neither D-Bus nor the control interface (components/wpa_supplicant/CMakeLists.txt has no ctrl_iface or dbus source), and the firmware has no dynamic loader or local users."
